"Connecting only halts and reads the target; it does not erase or flash. Disconnect before flashing a new ELF from the Flashing page." = "调试连接只暂停和读取目标，不会自动擦除或烧录。要把新 ELF 写入芯片，请先断开调试，再回到烧录页执行“烧录并校验”。";
"Connection halts the target without writing Flash. Match the ELF to the device firmware; source lines and local variables require debug symbols. F103/G4 use the same debug tools; no serial port is required." = "连接时暂停目标，不自动改写 Flash。请确保 ELF 与芯片程序一致；有 Debug 符号才可查看源码行和局部变量。F103/G4 使用同一免费调试链路，COM 无需选择。";
"Read-only inspection. F1/G4 use separate address tables. Generic entries have similar names; verify addresses against the device reference manual or SVD." = "仅提供只读查看。F1/G4 使用各自地址表；标记“通用”的寄存器名称相近，但仍应以当前型号参考手册或 SVD 为准。";
"Read any valid address. Common regions: SRAM 0x20000000, Flash 0x08000000. Verify peripheral addresses against the device reference manual or SVD." = "从任意有效地址读取。常见区域：SRAM 0x20000000，Flash 0x08000000；外设地址请以当前芯片参考手册或 SVD 为准。";
"Watches refresh on pause, step, or Refresh State. Inspect globals, structure members, array elements, and address expressions." = "添加后会在每次暂停、单步或点击“刷新状态”时重新读取。可监视全局变量、结构体成员、数组元素和地址表达式。";
"This writes the current ELF to Flash. Confirm the firmware matches %@." = "将用当前 ELF 改写 Flash。请确认固件与 %@ 匹配。";

